    "evidence": "Strong dark editorial direction, disciplined cyan/red/yellow accents, and a clear headline-to-card hierarchy across viewports. The card reflows cleanly on mobile. However, desktop composition leaves excessive dead space and awkwardly separates the artifact note from the headline; tablet/mobile typography includes very small, low-contrast mono text; and the global header visibly clips its navigation with an ambiguous “SWIPE” affordance. The mobile header also loses the brand name and red-mode action, weakening continuity and polish.",
